      {
        "id": 168260,
        "name": "Bard of the Runekeepers",
        "username": "Bard_of_the_Runekeepers",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bard_of_the_runekeepers/{size}/2482_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-16T18:23:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Their abilities don't seem to match up with Gloomweavers minions. I mean, none of them got any powers from the Grimor of Curses besides, like, shooting fire and infernal energies. But it seems like something Christopeher would do. I asked him on the redit page how much he had made of the story before the game was published, and he said the vast majority. So its possible.</p>",
