        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/edb3f5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-18T01:13:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm pretty sure they weren't connected to anyone possessing actual magical know-how. &nbsp;Their story reads to me like three goth kids with pretensions who got *really* lucky/unlucky and ran across an actual grimoire. &nbsp;Thus why their powers are less \"magical might\" and more \"occult radiation accident\".</p>",
